{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLARFLARE is a turn-based, tactical roguelike in a sci-fi dystopia. Play solo or team up with a friend, experiment to find broken builds, and defend your planet from the megacorp's bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST-PACED BUT TURN-BASED </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first mission, you'll act carefully, strategize with your team, and react to enemy counters as they appear. But once your build is fully armed and operational, you will hold down a button and watch enemies erupt around you in a glorious riot of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, things will not go as planned! This is incredibly exciting: an opportunity to go back to the drawing board and adjust your build. Maybe it was a <i>bad</i>\u00a0idea to buy three stacks of <strong>Sniper</strong> so early...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLO, OR UP TO FOUR-PLAYER CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play and win solo, but a frankly obscene number of novel builds open up when you join up with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/d5b5ff864753bb238e2816aaecfc2cf1.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/d5b5ff864753bb238e2816aaecfc2cf1.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/d5b5ff864753bb238e2816aaecfc2cf1.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Fox tanking, Ed is free to ignore defense and fire indiscriminately from the backline. Well, maybe not\u00a0<i>totally </i>ignore defense<i>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR EMPLOYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cold and indifferent galaxy, SOLARFLARE tries to be slightly warmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/ceb7fbd860b6a515f30be44fd59b09d2.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" aria-label=\"Image rotating through four characters: Fox, Bubblegum, Ed, and &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;\" width=376 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/ceb7fbd860b6a515f30be44fd59b09d2.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need the four of you to raid another megacorp, steal their equipment, sabotage their projects, and recruit their indentured employees. Don't worry, they started it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE A BROKEN BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Upgrade is weak in isolation but combines explosively with other Upgrades (and your teammates' Upgrades).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely! Or, more realistically: experiment, and die, and learn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941030?t=1756784366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941030?t=1756784366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/71c0c6fd94f0f1ec622c94fb107d845b1f78f2d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756784366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/71c0c6fd94f0f1ec622c94fb107d845b1f78f2d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756784366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLARFLARE is a turn-based, tactical roguelike in a sci-fi dystopia. Play solo or team up with a friend, experiment to find broken builds, and defend your planet from the megacorp's bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST-PACED BUT TURN-BASED </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first mission, you'll act carefully, strategize with your team, and react to enemy counters as they appear. But once your build is fully armed and operational, you will hold down a button and watch enemies erupt around you in a glorious riot of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, things will not go as planned! This is incredibly exciting: an opportunity to go back to the drawing board and adjust your build. Maybe it was a <i>bad</i>\u00a0idea to buy three stacks of <strong>Sniper</strong> so early...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLO, OR UP TO FOUR-PLAYER CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play and win solo, but a frankly obscene number of novel builds open up when you join up with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/d5b5ff864753bb238e2816aaecfc2cf1.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/d5b5ff864753bb238e2816aaecfc2cf1.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/d5b5ff864753bb238e2816aaecfc2cf1.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Fox tanking, Ed is free to ignore defense and fire indiscriminately from the backline. Well, maybe not\u00a0<i>totally </i>ignore defense<i>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR EMPLOYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cold and indifferent galaxy, SOLARFLARE tries to be slightly warmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/ceb7fbd860b6a515f30be44fd59b09d2.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" aria-label=\"Image rotating through four characters: Fox, Bubblegum, Ed, and &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;\" width=376 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/ceb7fbd860b6a515f30be44fd59b09d2.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need the four of you to raid another megacorp, steal their equipment, sabotage their projects, and recruit their indentured employees. Don't worry, they started it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE A BROKEN BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Upgrade is weak in isolation but combines explosively with other Upgrades (and your teammates' Upgrades).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.poster.avif?t=1756784366\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.webm?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.mp4?t=1756784366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely! Or, more realistically: experiment, and die, and learn.</p>","developers":["swarmforge"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/d36f4ae6e9bd050c115e0f54aceeab031b3fcf33/header.jpg?t=1756784366","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941030/1615395427/c365826fe847e6890cf8e814426add0a4a156272/1755303941/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756755294","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941030/1615395427/c365826fe847e6890cf8e814426add0a4a156272/1755303941/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756755294","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941030/1615395427/c365826fe847e6890cf8e814426add0a4a156272/175530394